       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PA.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-N      PIC 9(2).
       01  WS-I      PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-SUM    PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-CLASS  PIC X(5) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           ACCEPT WS-N
           PERFORM ADD-PARA VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-N
           PERFORM CLASSIFY-PARA
           DISPLAY "N=" WS-N " SUM=" WS-SUM " CLASS=" WS-CLASS
           IF WS-SUM > 20 MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE END-IF
           STOP RUN.
       ADD-PARA.
           COMPUTE WS-SUM = WS-SUM + WS-I.
       CLASSIFY-PARA.
           IF WS-SUM < 10 MOVE "SMALL" TO WS-CLASS
           ELSE IF WS-SUM < 30 MOVE "MID  " TO WS-CLASS
           ELSE MOVE "LARGE" TO WS-CLASS END-IF END-IF.
